{%- comment -%}
  DM Cart Drawer — the sidecart section, folded into footer-group.json by the
  publish transpiler (treeToShopifySectionGroup, footer only) so it renders on
  EVERY page: the cart trigger lives in the global header, so the drawer must
  be available on collection / cart / blog / search pages too.

  It wraps a single DM Sheet block (openOn:cart). dm-cart.js opens it on cart
  events; the Sheet's own overlay/panel CSS (off `data-state`, in dm-theme.css)
  owns the fixed-overlay positioning, so this section needs no bespoke CSS. The
  `shopify-section` wrapper (`tag: div` — sections require a string tag) has no
  layout effect: closed = zero height, open = the Sheet's fixed overlay escapes
  it. Section Rendering API refreshes (dm-cart.js) re-run the
  `{% for item in cart.items %}` loop + cart-goal fill inside.

  Section groups normally inherit dm-theme.css + the dm-*.js runtimes from
  dm-page.liquid (the body template) — but dm-page only renders on DM pages,
  and the drawer must work everywhere. So this section loads the subset it
  needs itself. On DM pages these duplicate dm-page's loads; the browser dedupes
  by asset URL and each runtime's init-flag guard makes re-injection a no-op.

  `dm-chrome.liquid` now applies the same rule to the header group, so its
  declaration usually lands earlier in the document than this one. Keep this one
  anyway: the two files reach a theme by different routes (engine push vs
  publish), so neither can assume the other is present. See `dm-chrome.liquid`.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'dm-theme.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'dm-theme-vars.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{% render 'dm-fonts' %}

{%- comment -%}
  Shop money format → window.dropmagic.formatMoney (dm-dropmagic.js reads this).
  Lets the cart drawer's optimistic render format cents client-side with no
  server round-trip. Emitted here so it's on every page the drawer renders.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/json" data-dm-money-format>{{ shop.money_format | json }}</script>

{% content_for 'blocks' %}

<script src="{{ 'dm-dropmagic.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'dm-sheet.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'dm-progress-bar.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'dm-cart.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "DM Cart Drawer",
  "tag": "div",
  "blocks": [{ "type": "@theme" }],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "number",
      "id": "goal_amount",
      "label": "Free-shipping goal",
      "info": "Threshold in cents (subtotal) or item count (quantity). Set by DropMagic from the store's cart reward settings. The nested cart-goal bar + `cart.goal_*` text binds read this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "goal_type",
      "label": "Goal type",
      "info": "`subtotal` (cents) or `quantity` (item count). Set by DropMagic.",
      "default": "subtotal"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "DM Cart Drawer" }]
}
{% endschema %}
